void disconnect_now(plid pid, integer reason) ->
Disconnects the client's ENet peer immediately (see <a rel=noreferrer href=http://sauerbraten.org/enet/group__peer.html#ga0e807704b6ecace5004c2cdcfbf813c2>enet_peer_disconnect_now()</a>). on_disconnect() is not called.

color get_fog(void) ->
Returns the current fog color.

table{number=nil|fvec3} get_intelloc(void) ->
Returns the locations of all intels. The table key is teamid+1 for some reason. If any intel is hidden, its value is <samp>nil</samp>.

table{number=nil|fvec3} get_tentloc(void) ->
Returns the locations of all tents. The table key is teamid+1. If any tent is hidden, its value is <samp>nil</samp>.

boolean input_on_stdin(void) ->
Deprecated.

void set_reload_time(plid pid, clk time) ->
Schedules reload_player() to be called for <var>pid</var> at <var>time</var>.
Unschedules instead if <var>time</var>=<kbd>0</kbd>.
